{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T01:36:12.846Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"d6e48bfd8a37bc5d501a64ca","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T01:36:12.846Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"node --test test/ui-config-routes.test.ts test/consent-notice.test.ts test/replay-privacy.test.ts","scope":"project","provenance":{"author":"pi-glm","created_at":"2026-11-09T01:36:12.819Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"feat/operator-consent-integration"}}]}],"before_hash":"5062986a420adf6866f8112318fbf55c93606830751a9eac975bbef3f74740bc","after_hash":"c1fb6076648aab074bdbf387d34f1ec630a6d9d414546bbef4318dabdaee722b","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ae3971967b5312e48d3cd24cc44e3442fe7294d22ecd20ff485ad3d166dd9cff"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T01:38:44.464Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"d6e48bfd8a37bc5d501a64ca","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T01:38:44.464Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-09T01:38:44.464Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Design: (1) New setting PM_WEB_STORAGE_NOTICE (default on; only the exact value 'off' disables) read per request by src/routes/ui-config.ts and exposed to the classic consent script via a minimal unauthenticated GET /api/ui-config -> {storageNotice:boolean}, mounted on the static-asset rate tier. Reusing /api/auth/oidc/config would not fit: the consent script is a classic script without the SPA api() wrapper, runs on the standalone legal pages too, and that route's shape (enabled,label) is OIDC-specific. (2) public/src/cookie-consent.ts resolves the config first (banner starts hidden, so no flash): with on, behaviour is unchanged; with off the banner never shows, nothing is written to pm_cookie_preferences_v1, and [data-cookie-settings] buttons are replaced by plain links to /cookie-settings (the operator's deployed legal page). Every fetch failure (network, non-OK, unparsable body) falls back to on, and the read never throws. (3) data-umami-block added to #main-app, #modal-container, #toast-container, #live-copy-announcement in index.html, plus self-marking for the dynamically created private overlays (graph context menu, graph tooltip, the two graph dependency modals inserted on body, both offline-recovery notices). Sign-in screen stays unblocked. No widely used vendor-neutral attribute convention was found for replay blocking, so only the tracker's own data-umami-block attribute API is used. (4) Sign-in start events: data-umami-event=auth_sign_in_started with provider password (#auth-submit) and oidc (#oidc-login); no user data in any attribute. (5) privacy-policy.html template gained an 'Analytics and consent management' section (operators must describe any analytics/consent manager, and PM_WEB_STORAGE_NOTICE=off is explained); README configuration table documents the setting. Branding rule kept: the vendor name appears nowhere visitor-visible, only in data-umami-* attribute names."}]}],"before_hash":"c1fb6076648aab074bdbf387d34f1ec630a6d9d414546bbef4318dabdaee722b","after_hash":"9d75ff2f69363364ed6cc72cd48c99ae57544b7864717e5313fc9984a189100c","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"5f59d9efbb16a9a28edc6a76dccd3fc29294d0ab242fc4b70eeb88563bf1767e"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T01:38:49.400Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"d6e48bfd8a37bc5d501a64ca","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-09T01:38:49.399Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Revert proof (behavioural, in the package worktree, originals restored and re-verified after each): reverting public/index.html to origin/main -> replay-privacy fails ('every private-content container carries data-umami-block' and 'sign-in start buttons'); reverting public/src/cookie-consent.ts to origin/main -> consent-notice fails (off: banner never shows / plain-link fallback / endpoint read, 3 failures, 5 pass); reverting only storageNoticeEnabled in src/routes/ui-config.ts to always return true -> ui-config-routes fails (off over real HTTP + case/whitespace variant + pure function, 3 failures, 5 pass). After restoration all three files pass again."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T01:38:49.400Z"}],"before_hash":"9d75ff2f69363364ed6cc72cd48c99ae57544b7864717e5313fc9984a189100c","after_hash":"7e6891d7973235ae8235f7d499396586e47a7b183b65c9e2b7c64d72cd74f912","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"4822cb23c9d8455b07cc6e1079b39bd35b0cf38731f2cd31c68837212b3fa22f"}
